# Secrets for the server functions. Copy to supabase/functions/.env for local
# development ({"_tag":"Error","error":{"code":"UnknownSubcommand","message":"Unknown subcommand "start\" for "supabase"

  Did you mean this?
    start"}} loads it), and set the same names with
